        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliechesio lieisiongo inzatishe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka OMWAMI yaboola; mbu Tsia okule isiongo yelitoyi eyomulonji, mana olanje abokhubakofu babandu nabokhubakofu babakuhani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "murule ninabo, mutsie khwibanda liomwana waHinomu, elili habwinjililo bweShilibwa shieTsinjio; mana orumbulileyo amakhuwa aka ndalakhuboolela; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "osunje mbu Hulile likhuwa liOMWAMI, inywe abaruchi baYuda nabamenyanga muYerusalemu; kano niko aka OMWAMI omwene mahe, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, aboola; mbu Lole, ndalakhupia habundu hano khushibii, eshilachila buli mundu yesi ouhulilakhwo alahuka okhushila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila bandekha, niboonoonia habundu hano, nibasambilamwo abanyasaye bandi amalesi kelibuuliesi, abanyasaye aba baramanya ta, kata bo kata abakuuka babwe kata abaruchi baYuda; nibeetsusia habundu hano amabanga kababula eshikha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niboembakha habundu aheechingu haBaali okhusambila abaana babwe mumulilo babe emisango emisambe khuBaali; ne ako shindalakakhwo, kata okhusunga, kata shikeenjila mumapaaro kanje ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho OMWAMI aboola mbu Khulwako, lole, tsindaalo tsiitsanga olwa habundu hano shihalalangwa mbu Tofetsi, kata Libanda liomwana waHinomu khandi ta, habula Libanda liObwiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalafubia tsiyemi tsiaYuda naYerusalemu habundu hano; ndalachila nibakwisibwa nolukanga imbeli wabasuleu babwe, khandi namakhono ka abo abayiima obulamu bwabwe; nemilambo chiabwe ndalachihaana chibe ebiliibwa biamanyonyi akomwikulu nende tsisolo etsiomushialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalakhola litookho lino libe eliamariisia, eliokhunyokhoosibwa; buli mundu oubirayo alariisibwa, nanyokhoosia khulwa amanyasio kalio kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalachila nibalia inyama yemibili chiabaana babwe abasiani neinyama yemibili chiabaana babwe abakhaana; kata balalia buli mundu inyama yomubili kwomwitsawe, mubwikalilwi nomumatinyu, olwa abasuku babwe nende abo abayiima obulamu bwabwe balabasandia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
